ttp://www.horiotoi.org/avatar/21/550240.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </td><td><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/user.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">  <span><b>G4n44</b></span><br> <img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/news.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Форум пост: <b>10</b><br> <img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/balloon.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Сэтгэгдэл: <b>1298</b><br> <img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/repa.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Үнэлгээ: <b>21</b><br> <img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/thx.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Цол: Үнэ цэнэтэй гишүүн<b> </b></td></tr></tbody></table>  <span></span></div><div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/avatar/60/025357.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> </td><td><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/user.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">  <span><b>arctic</b></span><br> <img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/news.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Форум пост: <b>855</b><br> <img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/balloon.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Сэтгэгдэл: <b>1219</b><br> <img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/repa.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Үнэлгээ: <b>89</b><br> <img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://webuilder.info/style/topuser/thx.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"> Цол: Шилдэг гишүүн<b> </b></td></tr></tbody></table>  <span></span></div><div>\n<!--Êîíåö Áëîê Êîìåíòàðèè(ñëåâà)-->\n\n<!--Áëîê Ññûëêè(ñëåâà)-->\n<h3>Social Networks</h3><div></div><div><ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/horiotoi\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Facebook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/horiotoi\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Twitter</a></li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<!--Êîíåö Áëîê Ññûëêè(ñëåâà)-->\n \n<!--Ñëàéäåð(öåíòð)-->\n<div>\n \n <div>\n<div>\n<strong>www.horiotoi.org</strong>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/horiotoi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/horiotoi.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n</a></div><a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/horiotoi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">\n\n </a></div><a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/horiotoi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"> \n<!--Êîíåö Ñëàéäåð(öåíòð)--> \n\n<!--Áëîê íîâîñòåé(öåíòð)-->\n</a><div><a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/horiotoi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><!-- <body> --></a><a href=\"http://horiotoi.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><!--<s5176>-->Буцах<!--</s>--></a> » » Хятад хуурамч өндөг\n<hr>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td>\n<div>\n<h1><a href=\"/article/3813\"></a></h1>\n<div>\n\n<ul><div><!--IMG1--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/80613876.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG1--></div>БНХАУ-ын зүүн хойд хэсгийн Хармөрөн, Шаньдун, Гуандун зэрэг мужид \nхуурамч өндөг аль хэдийнэ борлуулаад эхэлжээ. Химийн аргаар гарган авсан\n уг бүтээгдэхүүнийг \"резинэн өндөг” хэмээн тодорхойлж байгаа бөгөөд \nгаднаас нь хараад ялгах боломжгүй юм байна. Харин зах зээлийн үнээс 10 \nдахин бага үнээр борлуулж байсан хуурамч өндөгний хальс нилээд бөх \nбайжээ. Чанасны дараа цагаан, шар уураг нь хатуурч яг л резин шиг болж, \nбохь шиг сунадаг бөгөөд хуурамч өндөгний уургийн цэлцэгнүүрийг альгинат \nнатритай урвалдуулан гарган авч будагч бодис хольдог байна. Хальсны \nнайрлагад нь карбонат кальци, парафин, гипс орсон аж. Ийм өндгийг удаан \nхугацаагаар хэрэглэвэл хүүхдийн оюуны хөгжил удааширч, улмаар зогсонги \nбайдалд орох, томчуудын мэдрэлийн систем гэмтэх аюултай хэмээн \nмэргэжилтнүүд хэлж байна.<br><div><br><!--IMG2--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/56870463.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/47927348.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/64932632.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG4--><br><!--IMG5--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/53692877.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG6--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/25809313.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG6--><br><!--IMG7--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/63303681.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG7--><br><!--IMG8--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/37795260.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG8--><br><!--IMG9--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/84931460.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG9--><br><!--IMG10--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20121002023419im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/38/32705226.jpg\" load